                        </div> -->

                        <div style="padding:5px;">

                          <b><span t-field="o.company_id.name"/></b><br/>

                          <b> Bank Name : -  </b> <b><span t-field="o.partner_id.bank_name"/></b><br/>

                           <b>Account No. : -  </b> <b><span t-field="o.partner_id.ac_no"/></b><br/>

